{"unit_id": "acebang0303__dsh-quick-launch#feature-1", "repo": "acebang0303/dsh-quick-launch", "commit": "205327a2b17ee9ca7836db7554358bb540be8389", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-quick-launch 的功能「创建或更新桌面快捷方式」：在浮动面板填写名称并选择图标后创建或更新 Windows .lnk；启动器启动 DSH Web 并打开浏览器，若服务已运行则直接打开页面。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:365-385", "lib/launcher.mjs:241-268"]}
